    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Stalker",
    "summary": "Immediately after an enemy unit able to FLY begins or ends an Advance, Normal or Fall Back move, if you use the Overwatch Stratagem on this model, then while resolving that Stratagem this model may shoot that unit and also pick up to three other enemy units able to FLY that are within 24\" of it, firing its Icarus stormcannons at each of them that is an eligible target. Shots against those extra units score hits only on unmodified Hit rolls of 6.",
